## Not established

- With one worker, a pending substitution is first cut by a search for the value's free dimensions with a
  budget of 4,000 steps; with several workers it is not (1355–1374). Whether this changes any result or
  only the cost is not established.
- A path-typed recursive field more than 16 dimensions deep overruns a fixed array (2547–2548).
- "An eliminator of an unknown type gives an unknown type" erases the operands (1944–1950): what relies on
  it is not read.

